  "releaseNotes": "Reusable instructions, typed state paths, and question factories\n- Compose instructions with Instruction and InstructionWithState using GetInstructionPath, GetStatePath, and FormatInstruction for automatic backtick quoting.\n- Build property and constant array paths from typed selectors without reading values, including for root arrays.\n- Create Noul, Box, Choice, and Score definitions with QuestionDefinition factories; use the Interpolated variants to preserve reference arguments.",
